CDayTracker turns the resolver into an event. The EA calls Update() with the server time, the balance, and the equity of the moment. The first call reports TD_EVENT_FIRST. Every later call at or after the end of the current day reports TD_EVENT_NEW_DAY, and the tracker keeps the balance and equity of that call as the start values of the new day.
